{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22229","headline":"弄龟罗 · 白居易","name":"弄龟罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有侄始六岁，字之爲阿龟。\n有女生三年，其名曰罗儿。\n一始学笑语，一能诵歌诗。\n朝戏抱我足，夜眠枕我衣。\n汝生何其晚，我年行已衰。\n物情小可念，人意老多慈。\n酒美竟须坏，月圆终有亏。\n亦如恩爱缘，乃是忧恼资。\n举世同此累，吾安能去之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}